## Cookbooks {#cookbooks}

For more information on how to make use of Document QnA, we have the following [Document QnA Cookbook](https://colab.research.google.com/github/mistralai/cookbook/blob/main/mistral/ocr/document_understanding.ipynb) with a simple example.

### Are there any limits regarding the Document QnA API? {#are-there-any-limits-regarding-the-document-qna-api}

Yes, there are certain limitations for the Document QnA API. Uploaded document files must not exceed 50 MB in size and should be no longer than 1,000 pages.

QUESTION
Can Document QnA answer questions about an image (.png, .jpg), or does it only take PDFs?

ANSWER
No, the documentation only shows Document QnA being used with PDFs.

The [Document QnA usage examples](https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/document-processing/document_qna#usage ⟦CITED⟧) all demonstrate QnA with a PDF URL, a Base64-encoded PDF, or an uploaded PDF file. While the underlying OCR processor does support image formats, Document QnA itself is presented exclusively with PDFs in its documentation.

CITED URL
https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/document-processing/document_qna#usage

PASSAGE
Document QnA > Document AI QnA > Usage

