The models that support **document input in a chat message** are the **34 Document QnA models** (e.g., `mistral-large-2512`, `mistral-small-2506`, `pixtral-12b-2409`, etc.).
You pass the document in the `content` array of a user message using a `document_url` chunk:

```json
{
  "role": "user",
  "content": [
    {"type": "text", "text": "Your question about the document"},
    {"type": "document_url", "document_url": "data:application/pdf;base64,<base64_pdf>"}
