- **mistral-large-latest** (and versions: mistral-large-2-1-24-11, mistral-large-3-25-12)
- **codestral-latest** (and versions: codestral-25-01, codestral-25-08)
- **magistral-small-latest** (and versions: magistral-small-1-0-25-06, magistral-small-1-1-25-07, magistral-small-1-2-25-09)
- **magistral-medium-latest** (and versions: magistral-medium-1-0-25-06, magistral-medium-1-1-25-07, magistral-medium-1-2-25-09)
- **ministral-3b-latest**, **ministral-8b-latest** (and versions: ministral-3b-24-1, ministral-8b-24-1, ministral-3-3b-25-12, ministral-3-8b-25-12, ministral-3-14b-25-12)
- **mistral-nemo-12b-latest** (mistral-nemo-12b-24-07)
- **devstral-small-latest** (and versions: devstral-small-1-0-25-05, devstral-small-1-1-25-07, devstral-small-2-25-12)
